## $v — the shot's speed («3 km/s»); $outcome — lands, orbits (round the Earth), escapes (away for good); $range — where it came down, $time — after how long; $period — the period; $near, $far — the lowest and highest over the surface; $round — yes when the orbit is a circle.

newton-cannon-title = Newton’s cannonball: an artificial satellite of the Earth
